	"data": "Room 2.0 (ReactXR Prototype)\n\n\"Forget any amount of mixed reality. Go just full and hard on pure augmented reality.\" — cithoreal, May 2026\n\nPure AR system using Quest 3 to create contextual interfaces anchored to physical devices. Walk up to a Pi, see its context menu. The room becomes an interface.\n\nCurrent Status (2026-05-28)\nPhase 1 (Empty Room): Complete ✅\nPhase 2 (Tap to Place): Hit testing + anchor creation working ✅, anchor persistence + device association in progress\nECS + Linked Data…",
